      "description": "The image portrays a woman as the victim, which implicitly references societal stereotypes that women are more vulnerable to physical harm and crime. This stereotype is part of broader misogynistic tropes that portray women as passive, easily victimized, and less capable of defending themselves, which is a form of background knowledge needed to understand the meme's framing.",
