      "description": "The meme implicitly relies on misogynistic stereotypes by depicting a woman as the helpless victim of a violent crime. This reinforces the stereotype that women are inherently vulnerable and in need of protection, which is a harmful social construct. The background knowledge of misogyny is necessary to understand the societal implications of this portrayal.",
