      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_dadf8e85",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "woman",
      "description": "The intended audience is individuals who recognize and understand the trope of a woman being portrayed as a vulnerable victim in a robbery scenario, often reinforcing harmful gender stereotypes. The meme targets viewers familiar with media portrayals of gender-based vulnerability and coercive violence, particularly those who may internalize or be exposed to misogynistic narratives that depict women as passive and easily victimized. The audience is likely to include those who engage with internet memes that rely on shock value, fear, or social commentary, and who may be familiar with the visual language of crime and threat in popular culture.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
